# SHOWSTOPPER: the train's and the town's foes. Gourd cloaks come in from
# the sides firing wavy pairs, and every so often circle the car leaving
# bomb shots (shooting one defuses it); puffers dive over; toy trains run
# along; bombers on roofs lob bombs; snowmen rush and fire a star fan;
# rocketeers send a rocket up that comes down on a red X; copters sweep
# long arms; the town's wall guns fire three ways.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat stage 3
cheat arena
cheat god
cheat spawn gourd_cloak 40 3776
waituntil eb_7 >= 2 400
cheat foet 0 409
waituntil eb_4 >= 1 100
cheat clear
# a bomb shot defused by a shot
cheat face 6
cheat bullet 4 168 3776 0 0
press A 1
wait 20
expect eb_4 == 0
cheat clear
cheat spawn puffer 168 3686
wait 1
print foe0_y
wait 10
expect foe0_y > 3706
cheat clear
cheat spawn toy_train 20 3776
wait 10
expect foe0_x >= 38
cheat clear
cheat spawn bomber 168 3716
cheat foet 0 129
wait 2
expect eb_5 == 1
wait 52
expect eb_5 == 0
expect hz_2 >= 1
cheat clear
cheat spawn rocketeer 100 3736
cheat foet 0 149
wait 2
expect eb_6 == 1
expect hz_3 == 1
wait 62
expect hz_2 >= 1
cheat clear
cheat spawn snowman 168 3756
cheat foet 0 60
waituntil eb_1 >= 5 120
cheat clear
cheat spawn wall_gun 100 3756
expect kind_17 == 1
cheat foet 0 119
wait 2
expect eb_0 == 3
cheat clear
# the copter's arms hurt; the middle is what to shoot
cheat mortal
cheat spawn copter 168 3811
waituntil hits >= 1 60
